 "blocker_reason": "voxedge SherpaASRBackend.create_stream() (voxedge/backends/sherpa/asr.py:355-358) always builds a SherpaASRStream around self._online_recognizer, and never routes to self._offline_recognizer. The rpi5-sensevoice profile only sets ENSURE_OFFLINE_ASR/OFFLINE_ASR_PROVIDER (loads SenseVoice as the OFFLINE recognizer only), so self._online_recognizer stays None, has_capability(STREAMING) (asr.py:310-315) is False, and server/main.py:5350-5352 sends {\"error\": \"no streaming ASR available\"} and closes with code 1000 before any audio is processed -- confirmed in container logs (connection open immediately followed by connection closed for every one of the 20x4 requests). SenseVoice CPU has no /asr/stream path in this codebase version; it is only reachable via the offline POST /asr and /v1/asr endpoints (server/main.py:4964, 5049), which bench.py (WebSocket-only) does not call."
}